# Before: the derived function-call membership was not a candidate for nonzero proof.
# forall f fn(x R) R+:
#     f(0)!=0
# Now: use the actual declared return carrier and retain both membership proofs.
# Boundary: an R codomain alone does not imply nonzero; application guards still apply.
# Run: target/release/litex -strict -lang en -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_rule/nonzero_function_codomain.lit
forall f fn(x R) R+:
    f(0)!=0
forall f fn(x R) C*:
    f(0)!=0
